    "验证已超过 3 分钟，已停止本次操作。请保持应用在前台后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verification took over 3 minutes and was stopped. Keep the app in the foreground and try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "验证已超过 3 分钟，已停止本次操作。请保持应用在前台后重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
