    "验证码已发送到“%@”的受信任设备。请输入 6 位验证码以继续。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A code was sent to your trusted device “%@”. Enter the 6-digit code to continue."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "验证码已发送到“%@”的受信任设备。请输入 6 位验证码以继续。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
